    CONCLUSION, WRONG MECHANISM. A build following my version would have been "warned about the
    fixture" and still written shape A, believing it had accounted for the problem. A wrong mechanism
    carrying a right conclusion is harder to catch than a wrong conclusion, because the conclusion
    keeps agreeing with the evidence while the reason quietly does not.
